DESCRIPTION:Many of the University of Minnesota's introduced apple variet
 ies (https://mnhardy.umn.edu/apples/varieties) are for sale\, along with 
 gourmet packaged foods\, frozen pies\, pastries\, fudge\, gifts and — i
 n the fall — pumpkins\, squash and gourds\, also grown at the Arboretum
 . While supplies last\, the AppleHouse also offers delicious Goldy's Smok
 ehouse meats\, ice cream and Bee Lab honey from the University of Minneso
 ta College of Food\, Agricultural and Natural Resource Science (CFANS).&#
 160\;Nov. 6-Dec. 20: The AppleHouse transforms into a Holiday Boutique! O
 pen 9 a.m.-5 p.m. daily.&#160\;
