SUMMARY:The Brightness of Being | Cafe Gallery | University of Minnesota 
 Landscape Arboretum
DESCRIPTION:This is a curated celebration of the light that resides withi
 n the playful\, the small and the spirited. In a world that often feels h
 eavy\, this exhibition serves as a sanctuary of illumination — focusing
  on the literal brightness of the sun-drenched sky and the figurative bri
 ghtness of the human and animal spirit.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This is a curated celebration of the li
 ght that resides within the playful\, the small and the spirited. In a wo
 rld that often feels heavy\, this exhibition serves as a sanctuary of ill
 umination — focusing on the literal brightness of the sun-drenched sky 
 and the figurative brightness of the human and animal spirit.</p>
